{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "e32ad26ef20317a161387fdf1e0e8fded868b301c103818b056a800c86d3aa64", "ja": "14歳の挑戦", "zh": "14岁的挑战", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9c1efe650cd5bdc26903fef40c9ef05ca0b8db4a8b4914e225b693ee98634c51", "ja": "可奈とやよいのデュオ公演が決まった。\n曲はなんだか大人っぽくて、歌詞もちょっと\n難しい。だがこの曲で大人を目指してほしい\nというプロデューサーの言葉に背中を押され\n二人は大人らしく歌いこなす決意をする。", "zh": "可奈和弥生的双人公演已经决定了。\n歌曲有些成熟大人的风格，歌词也略显\n晦涩。但在制作人“希望借这首歌向大人迈进”\n的话语鼓励下，\n两人下定决心，要展现出大人的成熟韵味将它唱好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "64536b4660a01b91a0d8e32a2f1c627068488e3a2ef6ca9e1fd2b8506343222b", "ja": "（やよいと可奈のデュオ公演が決定！\n今は別件で撮影現場に来ているが……）", "zh": "（やよい和可奈的双人公演定下来了！虽然现在因为别的事情来到了拍摄现场，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "77bc095d8eb1415356592015105aaa116eadd83eaeffbfe2f6b9b8b8ac1c109a", "ja": "（午後からは二人とミーティングの予定だ！\n終わり次第すぐに劇場へと戻ろう！）", "zh": "（下午开始就要和她们两个人开会了！\n结束后马上回剧场吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "6c392c2dbe46ec99392aa683076ef9831de6b785e3a29f678e6efa6bb2d6932e", "ja": "やよいちゃんとデュオ公演だ～♪\nウキウキしちゃうぞ～、やったった～♪", "zh": "要和小弥生一起双人公演啦～♪\n心里好激动呀～，太棒啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "35902736787c2613c602043612263828791f225b0a921cb994d40d10ce753e20", "ja": "えへへ♪　私もすっごく嬉しいな～。\n私たち、どんな歌を歌うんだろうね？", "zh": "嘿嘿♪我也特别开心呢～  \n我们要唱什么样的歌呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "2491dcb4607e8f51713951ee059ab4b2072266c12e550e6aeb9338712e1e0423", "ja": "気になるよね～！　私とやよいちゃんだから……\nやっぱり明るくて元気な感じかな？", "zh": "你也很好奇吧～！毕竟是我和弥生嘛……果然会是明快又充满活力的风格吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "bd0d307ce6a447b443b0911ae9b78fe681799f2d213a4db03974d11ef8c3fe0b", "ja": "あっ、そうかも！　私元気なら自信あるし、\n可奈ちゃんは歌が大好きだもんね！", "zh": "啊，说不定真是这样！我对让自己充满活力可是很有自信的，\n可奈最喜欢唱歌了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "7f0ccfbe16c2235e9a772d2f4bde22b0e48dfc0cb573a8e81106f10445f188fb", "ja": "うん！　元気にいっぱい歌おうね！\nら～～～～～ららららら～～～♪", "zh": "嗯！精神饱满地尽情唱吧！\n啦～～～～～啦啦啦啦啦～～～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1007_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a448c6ac5e39e31c3804da31bdab8e552dedced1cf3acce28acbca74ac5558b9", "ja": "お疲れさま。\n二人とも早めに来てくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n看来你们两个都提前到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
