{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "848bbc527f4c1bfc35b1a18c5d3b4f7d80938506644f7c75d64ca64dd445fc34", "ja": "わあ～……♪", "zh": "哇～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ce684556078127c517a3e513759b10e0da3090db6e08dc44e16cfa920876d7ac", "ja": "やよいちゃん、可奈ちゃん、お疲れさま。\nもしかして、待たせちゃった？", "zh": "弥生、可奈，辛苦了。\n该不会让你们等久了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "f99a2e1185e2733f365d59fa491fd79dc110065213671fd49488c757ef0ab059", "ja": "ごめんね、私たちの撮影が押しちゃって……\nって、二人とも、どうかした？", "zh": "对不起，我们的拍摄耽搁了……\n咦，你们两个，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "859e0789e38619a1b91586115bcd1243c40176bf8113ecf887b7ba3578a61fa4", "ja": "莉緒さんと風花さん、とってもきれいですー！！", "zh": "莉绪姐和风花姐，真的好漂亮——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "7865b62c7c6bf13d81e2f71f06c33e80fbbc0508d2bc26cec6be98cc5c136ab3", "ja": "う、うん！\n思わず見惚れちゃいました～！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！\n我不由得都看入迷了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "5e2345cb86b77b15da2dd3e6704a9a64c00a0c3e5f60b686810a7da2278d6132", "ja": "あら、ありがと♪　この衣装、私たちもデザインから\n関わらせてもらったのよ。ね、風花ちゃん？", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢♪这套服装我们也是从设计阶段就参与进去了呢。对吧，风花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c9cbfd2716eb1bd690fc502251869be2c4291b61d234fe586d1bebf821eb39c7", "ja": "そうなの。上手に仕立ててもらえて、うれしくて……\nつい、着たまま帰ってきちゃった♪", "zh": "是呀。能被巧妙地设计出来，我特别开心……\n一不小心就直接穿着回来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "89fd381f5fe278f63951758ebf55a8a5688760a1978f9df69e9095b696bfcb30", "ja": "衣装デザイン……！？\nすご～～～い……！", "zh": "服装设计……！？\n好——厉——害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "b8ea39d9cc97aea3c904346215f4db1d6822af603a99ccc0df5dea0eca2359ef", "ja": "ウフフ……セクシー過ぎて、\n二人には刺激が強かったかしら？", "zh": "呵呵……是不是性感过头了，对你们两个来说刺激太大了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "34516b8a601dfc2973329d13edf08dd86c8640b51b57210bf288e21f17b15def", "ja": "それにいい匂いもします！　何を食べたら\nこんないい匂いのお姉さんになれるんですかー？", "zh": "而且身上还有香味！到底要吃什么，才能变成这么香的姐姐呀——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2f24230d4acc4b38cac9828aa00b4ad20bcc748b8e7777de8dc482dd06b579f0", "ja": "食べ物はわからないけど……でも大丈夫。\n二人とも、すぐ素敵なお姉さんになれるから。", "zh": "吃什么我就不知道了……不过没关系。\n你们两个马上就能成为很棒的姐姐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "04a4fcc508868d25965594b37ffe60c155f17f1c6d9c5f181ff2c1786dccd63a", "ja": "さぁ、そんなやよいと可奈の話をしないとな。\n莉緒、風花、お疲れさま。グラビアの件はまた後で。", "zh": "好了，得说说这样的弥生和可奈了。  \n莉绪、风花，辛苦了。写真拍摄的事之后再说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "363ec5899bf001d8949610b0c76d719c4498bfe08ce9ae549cefbe442d4b22df", "ja": "はーい。{$P$}くんも、\n小さなレディに失礼のないようにするんだぞ？", "zh": "好——。{$P$}也要注意，别对小淑女失礼哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8f2c14175021dd0eb6831a3cc007c4e154be33cbee3da47a4ac5e42fe3a242de", "ja": "やよいちゃん、可奈ちゃん、ミーティング頑張ってね。\nそれじゃ、いったん失礼します♪", "zh": "弥生、可奈，会议加油哦。\n那么，我先告辞啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "4879376204b2981ea3fa97e4e79e658d6ee61eac36ad04f94a56aa6b37348f42", "ja": "はぁ～……。\n大人のお姉さんだぁ……。", "zh": "哈啊～……  \n真是成熟的大姐姐啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "79ed7f57bc11ed7cef0a98ebed001b6aa2b6cf351165de6dd885f08bb9d4459e", "ja": "ねー！　素敵なお姉さん過ぎるよ～……。", "zh": "对吧——！简直就是大姐姐中的大姐姐～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "ed1759b3e9bb64028263e72b3b1ad46239188a3785941448272df49a3748b58b", "ja": "二人とも、莉緒と風花のことが\n気になるかもしれないが……。", "zh": "两位可能会对莉绪和风花的事感到在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "d4510a40c9cb51e4d14647fcb9215045c9e15267ece33c7ae9b652a5dae242fc", "ja": "今はデュオ公演の話をしよう！\n幸い、大人の女性に憧れてるところみたいだし。", "zh": "现在先说说双人演出吧！\n幸好，她们好像都憧憬着成熟女性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "1642efca5c29ddb37073d553dcef13df945f564f8088e86d82d56d6c0e61d474", "ja": "今回の新曲は、そんな二人にちょうどいい……\nかもしれない！　まずは聞いてみようか。", "zh": "这次的新曲，正适合她们两个人……\n也许吧！先听听看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
