{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1036_005yay", "source_sha256": "5b1aaec6921350d7c95d82c381aa0b43896d88abc55f6a95899e380c1b6602bb", "ja": "どんな歌詞なんだろ～。\nえっとえっと……、え～っと？", "zh": "会是什么样的歌词呢～  \n呃呃……呃～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "6710b8fe35cef13e0fe0973ed3ffcb05d0f7326c8f31a842cc01add8e6e65d8c", "ja": "ら、らせん……りかいって……あ、わかって……\nむ、難しい……。", "zh": "螺、螺旋……理解就是……啊，明白……\n好、好难懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "ba22882d122aec222f82866ce60b631c46a69c956a784f370ecdb2a4df226ab0", "ja": "どういう意味なんだろ～？\nらせんって、バネみたいなヤツのことだよね？", "zh": "到底是什么意思呢～？\n螺旋就是像弹簧一样的东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1039_005yay", "source_sha256": "5aac4d0b8eedd15410f257f2aa6b6ab091c9bf6abbc4c2e7bf26ab0fa29ace8a", "ja": "バネの絵をくっきり描きたい……\nみたい、な？", "zh": "我想把弹簧画得清清楚楚……\n大概，是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "8b110662a6861171f6d4440452994a87f5650005170284f3e0f15324526d53b8", "ja": "感情が乗れば、歌詞の意味はそんなに\n掘り下げなくても大丈夫だと思うよ。", "zh": "只要带上感情，我觉得歌词的含义不用挖得太深也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "7bff80cfc743088858792c621162e1162b5c60963c75fc1df56fa586da8cc98f", "ja": "どうかな？　この曲で、あくまでやよいらしく、\n可奈らしく、大人を目指してほしい。", "zh": "怎么样？希望你们用这首歌，保持弥生和可奈的本色，朝着成为大人的目标努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1042_005yay", "source_sha256": "7a8f82f2f3bf403f1a1d1400de3ffa49741c26864ee7debfb16c6d14834e6981", "ja": "大人……！\nさっきの莉緒さんたちみたいに……！", "zh": "大人……！\n像刚才的莉绪小姐她们那样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1043_036kan", "source_sha256": "d9a56e279e00c38174d9131289ad4e6575e79b63d5a69e6dab43384c9ddb0590", "ja": "やよいちゃん……やろう！　私達、まだ中学生だけど、\n育ちゃん達より大人だもん！", "zh": "弥生……来试试吧！虽然我们还只是初中生，\n但总比育她们更像大人呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1044_005yay", "source_sha256": "9ebc3260182d65ea0988a27f476a01c2cd5fc862058e931d4fb4c69c02d9818b", "ja": "！　そうだよね！\nそういえば私、家ではお姉さんだし！", "zh": "！对呀！\n说起来，我在家里也是姐姐嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "daa4dae2799c17881d92141ff477f64fca61adcc766ff0a603c8d0c8b960094d", "ja": "おお、自信がみなぎってきたな。\nそれならこの新曲……。", "zh": "哦，自信满满起来了嘛。\n既然这样，这首新歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1046_036kan", "source_sha256": "20d226f9dd7990e51b2d1e79c3e783161ee61d06b3267ec27ed9754ab9042b2a", "ja": "やってみたいです！　『すぐ素敵なお姉さんに\nなれる』って言ってもらえましたから！", "zh": "我想试试！因为大家都夸我\n“马上就能成为很棒的大姐姐”了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1047_005yay", "source_sha256": "81b0e5b55b192a2e81100dbd49750ea1e9f7cb230c6fbb7b9176a3bdd2bcccae", "ja": "電車だってもう大人料金だし、\n14歳はもう大人ですよね！", "zh": "就连坐电车也已经是成人票了，14岁已经算大人了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_01_1048_036kan", "source_sha256": "ed93791747c1868349f4f52cbf58499b2b2a77e0cbcb79f00eff98576e601131", "ja": "ねー！", "zh": "就是说嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
